        ],
        "type": "single_choice",
        "question": "下面程序（Aggressive Cows 类二分）的运行结果为（　）。\n// a[] = {1,2,8,4,9}, k=3\nbool check(...) { /* 贪心统计间距 ≥ dist 可放置的结点数 cnt，返回 cnt >= k */ }\nint solve(...) {\n    sort(a, a+n);\n    int l = 0, r = a[n-1] - a[0];\n    while (l < r) { int mid = (l+r+1)/2; if (check(n,a,k,mid)) l = mid; else r = mid - 1; }\n    return l;\n}",
        "options": {
            "A": "2",
            "B": "3",
            "C": "4",
            "D": "5"
        },
        "answer": "B",
        "explanation": "排序后 a={1,2,4,8,9}，二分最大化最小间距：dist=3 可选 {1,4,8} 满足 k=3，dist=4 只能选 2 个，答案 3。"
    },
